  "details": "this has been going on for years now and its been getting progressively worse now, it started once a month, then twice a month, then a couple times a week, now every day people are getting blocked by youtube's botcheck forcing people to use messy work arounds or modded versions of yt-dlp to get around youtube blocking videos. \n\nyoutube is one of the main things people use to play content on the videoplayers but they are breaking every day now.\n\nplease use some kind of proxy or a better solution than yt-dlp because this is a daily issue now, and i am even having to restart modded versions of it multiple times before anything plays. \n\nits messy, annoying, and it ruins the immersive expirience of being on a platform where you can do anything with your friends, especially in game worlds that require youtube access to play content related to the games. or nightclubs where music is played off youtube for music/dj nights\n\nplease find a permanent solution.",
